              <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--block-menu-and-text paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="panel-start"   >
    <div class="container  ">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col col-12 col-lg-6 main-block animated">
                      
      <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-block-content field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field--items">
              <div class="field--item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--menu-block paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-menu field--type-block-field field--label-hidden field--item"><nav role="navigation" aria-labelledby="block-homegettingstartedviolator-menu" id="block-homegettingstartedviolator" class="block block-menu navigation menu--home-get-started-violator">
      
  <h2 id="block-homegettingstartedviolator-menu">Achieve your educational &amp; professional goals</h2>
  

        


              <ul class="clearfix menu menu--home-get-started-violator nav">
                    <li class="nav-item">
                <a href="/areas-of-interest" target="_self" rel="" class="nav-link nav-link--areas-of-interest" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/54">View our programs</a>
              </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                <a href="/course-schedules-transcripts-and-resources" target="_self" class="nav-link nav-link--course-schedules-transcripts-and-resources" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/2167">Schedule, Transcripts &amp; Resources</a>
              </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                <a href="/apply-housing" class="nav-link nav-link--apply-housing" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/1105">Apply for Housing</a>
              </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                <a href="https://www.njc.edu/#virtualtour" class="nav-link nav-link-https--wwwnjcedu-virtualtour" target="_blank">Virtual Tour</a>
              </li>
        </ul>
  


  </nav>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
  
                  </div>
        <div class="col col-12 col-lg-6 subtitle animated">
                      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><p>Located in Sterling, Colorado, Northeastern Junior College combines the benefits of big-school amenities with the affordability of a small-school experience. We take pride in offering a comprehensive range of student services, including residence life, student housing, athletics, and performing arts, to ensure an engaging and well-rounded college experience. Our mission is to foster excellence in every student by providing a strong foundation of knowledge, advancing skills, and preparing them for educational transfer or successful entry into the workforce.</p><p>See us on <a href="https://www.njc.edu/about-us/college-tour">The College Tour</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></div>
      
                  </div>
	</div>
  </section>

            

  <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--region paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="panel-discover"   >
    <div class="container ">
          
      <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-paragraphs field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field--items">
              <div class="field--item">

  <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-block paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="panel-discover-intro"   >
    <div class="">
    	
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><div class="row"><div class="animated col-md-6"><h3>Discover NJC</h3></div><div class="subtitle animated col-md-6"><p>Northeastern delivers a big-school experience at a&nbsp;small-school price. The numbers add up: 900 full-time students from around&nbsp;the world, more than&nbsp;2,000 part-time students, more than 80 programs of study,&nbsp;and&nbsp;residence halls for more than 575 students.</p></div></div></div>
      
    	</div>
  </section>
</div>
              <div class="field--item">

  <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-block paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="panel-youvisit"   >
    <div class="">
    	
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><div style="min-height:500px;"><a href="https://www.youvisit.com/#/vte/?data-platform=v&amp;data-link-type=immersive&amp;data-inst=62555&amp;data-loc=143829&amp;data-stopid=285719&amp;data-image-width=100%&amp;data-image-height=100%&amp;" alt="Launch Experience">Launch Welcome</a></div><script async="async" defer="defer" src="https://www.youvisit.com/tour/Embed/js3">
</script></div>
      
    	</div>
  </section>
</div>
              <div class="field--item">

  <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--region paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="panel-discover-boxes"   >
    <div class="">
          
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col col-12 col-lg-6">
          
      <div class="field field--name-field-paragraphs-left field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field--items">
              <div class="field--item">  <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-box animated paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="box-visit"   >
    <a class="overlay-box-link" href="/visit-campus"></a>    <div class="inner  ">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field--item">Visit Campus</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><p>In addition to Northeastern Preview days, individual campus visits can be scheduled with the admissions department. Meet with an admissions staff member, take a tour of campus, and ask questions of an academic or faculty advisor.</p></div>
      
    	</div>
  </section>
</div>
              <div class="field--item">  <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-box animated paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="box-mlc"   >
    <a class="overlay-box-link" href="/mlc"></a>    <div class="inner  ">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field--item">Monahan Learning Center</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><p>The MLC promotes students' academic growth by providing a variety of services and assisting with individual academic needs in order to help students make the most of their educational experience.&nbsp;Student resources&nbsp;include&nbsp;the Library, Tutoring, Jumpstart, Trio Program &amp; Accessibility&nbsp;Services.</p></div>
      
    	</div>
  </section>
</div>
          </div>
  
        </div>
        <div class="col col-12 col-lg-6">
          
      <div class="field field--name-field-paragraphs-right field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field--items">
              <div class="field--item">  <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-box animated paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="box-living"   >
    <a class="overlay-box-link" href="/living-on-campus"></a>    <div class="inner  ">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field--item">Living On Campus</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><p>NJC has six on-campus residence halls that house more than 575 students.&nbsp;Northeastern is the largest two-year residential college in Colorado.</p><div class="align-center media--type-image media-view-mode-inline-original">
  
  
            <div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field--item">    <img loading="lazy" srcset="/sites/default/files/living-on-campus-girls-103119.jpg 1x" width="620" height="730" src="/sites/default/files/living-on-campus-girls-103119.jpg" alt="Students studying on the lawn of the Monahan Learning Center at Northeastern Junior College. Students can expect to receive free tutoring at the MLC, as well as many other services to help along their educational journey at NJC.">


</div>
      
</div>
</div>
      
    	</div>
  </section>
</div>
          </div>
  
        </div>
      </div>
    	</div>
  </section>
</div>
              <div class="field--item">  <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-box animated paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="box-activities"   >
    <a class="overlay-box-link" href="/student-activities"></a>    <div class="inner  ">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field--item">Student Activities</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><p>Northeastern offers students an amazing array of opportunities to get involved with fellow students, faculty and the local community. From student government to livestock judging, chess club to NJCAA athletics, opportunities to expand horizons through extracurricular involvement abound. Get involved, and discover how you can build lifelong relationships through enriching experiences beyond the classroom at Northeastern!</p></div>
      
    	</div>
  </section>
</div>
          </div>
  
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col col-12 col-lg-6">
          
        </div>
        <div class="col col-12 col-lg-6">
          
        </div>
      </div>
    	</div>
  </section>

            
  
  <section class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-views-reference paragraph--view-mode--default"  id="panel-pride-points"  >
         <div class="container">           <div class="view-header">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col col-12 col-lg-6"><h3 class="viewsreference--view-title animated">
    Why NJC
</h3>
</div>
          <div class="col col-12 col-lg-6">
  <div class="field animated field--name-field-paragraph-header-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><p>Our students come first. The faculty and staff of&nbsp;Northeastern are dedicated to helping every Northeastern student&nbsp;strive for and achieve their respective&nbsp;educational goals.</p></div>
</div>
        </div>
      </div>
              
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-views-reference field--type-viewsreference field--label-hidden field--item"><div class="views-element-container"><div class="view view-njc-pride-points view-id-njc_pride_points view-display-id-front_page js-view-dom-id-31070055481fa6509d80b8969abcd4e9d7952625681dbd4e31d12d97edbe2242">
  
    
      
